<title>USA: Florida to sell $44.335 mln transport GOs Monday.</title>
<headline>Florida to sell $44.335 mln transport GOs Monday.</headline>
<dateline>TALLAHASSEE, Fla 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Florida will sell $44.335 million of general obligation bonds for transportation by competitive bid at 1 p.m. EST Monday, the state Division of Bond Finance said.</p>
<p>The issue is designated Florida Department of Transportation Right-of-Way Acquisition and Bridge Construction Refunding Bonds, Series 1996. It refunds part of the department's 1991 series.</p>
<p>--Jane Sutton, 305-374-5013</p>
